entor-animation-grow elementor-repeater-item-c02c701\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/island_widevpl?igsh=NHFmZnhuaHdwa2xo&#038;utm_source=qr\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-screen-only\">Instagram<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fab fa-instagram\"><\/i>\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-grid-item\" role=\"listitem\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-icon elementor-social-icon elementor-social-icon-tiktok elementor-animation-grow elementor-repeater-item-dcc756a\" href=\"https:\/\/www.tiktok.com\/@islandwidevpl?_r=1&#038;_t=ZS-98kWJNzuyc1\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-screen-only\">Tiktok<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fab fa-tiktok\"><\/i>\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4c96e96 elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"4c96e96\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;stretch_section&quot;:&quot;section-stretched&quot;,&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-38282fe\" data-id=\"38282fe\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ffaa75 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8ffaa75\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Our vision is simple:<\/strong><br \/>To unite the EA SPORTS FC community across Southeast Asia on one platform.<\/p><p>We organise a variety of EA SPORTS FC competitions, including:<\/p><p>\u2022 Pro Clubs (11v11)<br \/>\u2022 1 v 1 Competitions<br \/>\u2022 2 v 2 Competitions (Coming Soon)<br \/>\u2022 More exciting tournaments and leagues in the future.<\/p><p><strong>Our primary communities are:<\/strong><\/p><p>\u2022 Singapore\u00a0<br \/>\u2022 Malaysia<br \/>\u2022 Indonesia<br \/>\u2022 Thailand<br \/>\u2022 Brunei<\/p><p>At IWVPL, we believe every player deserves a professional, fair, and enjoyable competitive experience. Our team is committed to providing the best possible administrative support before, during, and after every competition. Whether it&#8217;s match scheduling, resolving disputes, or answering your questions, we&#8217;ll always do our best to support our community.<\/p><p>As we continue to grow, we warmly welcome:<\/p><p>\u2022 New sponsors and business partners<br \/>\u2022 Community feedback and ideas<br \/>\u2022 Content creators and streamers<br \/>\u2022 Volunteers who share our passion for growing the <strong>EA SPORTS FC<\/strong> scene<\/p><p>Most importantly, we don&#8217;t want <strong>IWVPL<\/strong> to feel like just another organisation.<\/p><p>We want it to feel like family.<\/p><p>Every player, manager, streamer, sponsor, and supporter is an important part of our journey. We&#8217;ll celebrate your victories, help you through challenges, and continue building a community where everyone feels welcome.<\/p><p>Whether you&#8217;re competing on the virtual pitch or simply hanging out in our Discord, our promise remains the same:<\/p><p>IWVPL will always be here for you\u2014both in the game and beyond it.<\/p><p>One Community. One Passion. One League.<br \/><strong>Island-Wide Virtual Premier League (IWVPL).<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t